{"version":1,"key":"card:710","content":{"id":710,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"经济下行的时候，我们总能看到政府大搞基建：修高铁、建机场、扩公路。为什么经济越差，政府反而越要花钱？这背后的理论支撑就是乘数效应，凯恩斯主义中的一个核心概念。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/input-image-1778920511084_223e6cb4-1d6f-4040-a6ec-5100d1a4cc56.webp","uuid":"947c8d6e-846f-4b20-a6bb-82979d5f5f8c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/input-image-1778920511084_223e6cb4-1d6f-4040-a6ec-5100d1a4cc56.webp","width":512},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"它的逻辑建立在一个朴素的事实上：一个人的支出就是另一个人的收入。假设政府投资了 100 元修路，施工队拿到这 100 元后不会全部存起来，而是把其中 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"80\\%","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 花出去，比如买材料、吃饭。这 80 元又变成了别人的收入，别人再把 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"80\\%","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 花出去，如此一轮轮传递下去。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"用数学来表达这个过程，就是一个等比数列求和："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"block-math","tex":"\\sum_{i=0}^{\\infty} Iq^{i} = I \\cdot \\frac{1}{1 - q}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"其中 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"I","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是初始投入，"},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"q","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是​"},{"type":"formatted","text":"边际消费倾向","bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，即每增加一单位收入中用于消费的比例。"},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"k = \\dfrac{1}{1 - q}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就是乘数。当 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"q = 0.8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时，"},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"k = \\dfrac{1}{1 - 0.8} = 5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，意味着政府每投入 1 元，最终能在整个经济体中产生 5 元的国民收入。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这就是凯恩斯主义强调政府投资的理论基础：当企业和居民都不敢花钱的时候，政府站出来花第一笔钱，通过乘数效应层层放大，重新激活整个经济循环。"}],"disableDrag":false}],"tags":["经济/乘数效应","概念"],"createTime":1778918899287,"updateTime":1778920674650,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1778920674650}}